WEBVTT

00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:07.937
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Is there a cash machine near here?

00:00:17.831 --> 00:00:19.164
Thanks very much.

00:00:29.037 --> 00:00:30.124
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> You’re welcome.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.862
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> I don’t believe it!

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.484
Excuse me, this cash machine isn’t working.

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:07.872
It only takes about 15 minutes.

00:01:18.127 --> 00:01:21.057
Turn left when you leave the station.